// PQC Wonderland: the Reference shelf. A glossary of every term the Tutorial and the Classroom use, and one card per
// algorithm: what it is, the mathematics under it, and where to read more. Loaded the first time the Reference section
// opens. In any text, [[id]] links to a glossary entry and [[id|words]] links with other words; the page checks that every
// link resolves. Links out of the page are [label, url] pairs, opened in a new tab.

